  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Aquaculture Fish (Self-help Grant).Beneficiaries: 429 of which 214 are women.This small grant Masembura aquaculture project will help small scale farmers to earn increased income. USADF funds will help 429 people to purchase fish cage materials, fingerlings, fish feed, and cover the cost of training, workshops, travel, communication and bank charges.</narrative>
